edProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1489690565"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 5, 2012 at 2:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3813318808297668878</id><published>2012-03-03T11:29:08.030-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-03T11:29:08.030-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m reminded of a video showing what happens w...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m reminded of a video showing what happens when People file a complaint with the police. It wasn&amp;#39;t a nice and pretty expereince.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Wish I could find the link. There&amp;#39;s just so many such links these days, and that&amp;#39;s Not a good thing.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/3813318808297668878'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/3813318808297668878'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html?showComment=1330799348030#c3813318808297668878' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296140933630473498' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8296140933630473498' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-482294404"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 3, 2012 at 11:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7454494346759911112</id><published>2012-03-01T19:06:27.312-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-01T19:06:27.312-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous @11:43,&#xa;Just remember that a backward el...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous @11:43,&lt;br /&gt;Just remember that a backward elbow or a palm to the nose is much less likely to cause damage to you. Punching is likely to result in broken bones in your hand. A good chop to the throat is also highly effective.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/7454494346759911112'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/7454494346759911112'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html?showComment=1330653987312#c7454494346759911112' title=''/><author><name>Isaac</name><uri>http://www.thestanfielddoctrine.blogspot.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296140933630473498' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8296140933630473498' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-853646409"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2012 at 7:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5164864550202426004</id><published>2012-03-01T14:26:26.804-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-01T14:26:26.804-07:00</updated><title type='text'>In &amp;#39;98 the SC of Wisconsin struck down the rig...</title><content type='html'>In &amp;#39;98 the SC of Wisconsin struck down the right to resist unlawful arrest. However, we still have the right to resist when excessive force is used. Of course, the victim would have a very different definition of excessive force than the perpetrator. When my father was young, he beat up a cop who was beating the crap out of his friend. This was back in the 50&amp;#39;s and he was never caught. Today he would be tracked down, tased, flashbanged and everything else.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;               Dan</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/5164864550202426004'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/5164864550202426004'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html?showComment=1330637186804#c5164864550202426004' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296140933630473498' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8296140933630473498' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-787611801"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2012 at 2:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2125149837307749095</id><published>2012-03-01T13:26:43.325-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-01T13:26:43.325-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I knew this scum bag when I worked as a security g...</title><content type='html'>I knew this scum bag when I worked as a security guard at Fifth Avenue Place.  We were both working for Cauley Detective Agency and I got him removed from his position there.  He was always making offensive remarks to the women who passed by the front desk among other things.  I never actually thought any police department would hire this guy...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/2125149837307749095'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/2125149837307749095'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html?showComment=1330633603325#c2125149837307749095' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296140933630473498' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8296140933630473498' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1052622054"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2012 at 1:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5467552252667308584</id><published>2012-03-01T11:43:01.058-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-01T11:43:01.058-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Meanwhile for those of us unwilling to wait for th...</title><content type='html'>Meanwhile for those of us unwilling to wait for the very uncertain legislative process (keep in mind such a law runs counter to the interests of the ruling class), we are just going to have to resist without worrying too much about legislative sanction. A potentially difficult course, but there are limits to what a person will put up with. It&amp;#39;s the assailant who forces the choice on us; he doesn&amp;#39;t wait for the legislature either.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/5467552252667308584'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/5467552252667308584'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html?showComment=1330627381058#c5467552252667308584' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296140933630473498' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8296140933630473498' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1414274308"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2012 at 11:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7659900628703953162</id><published>2012-03-01T10:46:15.924-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-01T10:46:15.924-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m very proud to note that a similar bill has...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m very proud to note that a similar bill has been introduced this year in my home state of New Hampshire. HB 1212, sponsored by freedom-fighting State Reps. George Lambert and Andrew Manuse, would make it legal for citizens to resist unlawful arrests.  Predictably, NH&amp;#39;s Criminal Justice and Public Safety committee voted against the bill, but it still has to go before the full House for a binding vote.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s not as comprehensive as the model statute you&amp;#39;ve outlined, but it&amp;#39;s still very heartening to see some Mundane pushback against the praetorians through official channels.  Hopefully we&amp;#39;ll start to see more such bills introduced in other states as well.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/7659900628703953162'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/7659900628703953162'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html?showComment=1330623975924#c7659900628703953162' title=''/><author><name>Chandler</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296140933630473498' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8296140933630473498' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1743498532"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2012 at 10:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6712545906373967574</id><published>2012-03-01T09:00:18.663-07:00</published><updated>2012-03-01T09:00:18.663-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Reminds me of the movie The Bad Lieutenant. These ...</title><content type='html'>Reminds me of the movie The Bad Lieutenant. These predations regularly occurred in the Soviet Union right before the collapse. A woman would go to the station to report a rape then get raped at the station by the state sanctioned gangstas. How about that great society and fifty years of liberalism. No need for morals or codes of ethics. Anything goes everything is ok.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/6712545906373967574'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8296140933630473498/comments/default/6712545906373967574'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html?showComment=1330617618663#c6712545906373967574' title=''/><author><name>A. Nonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/03/uniformed-sexual-predator-deterrence.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296140933630473498' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8296140933630473498' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1205239569"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2012 at 9:00 AM"/></entry></feed>